we add two usable directed edges in the flow network:
  u -> v with capacity c, cost 0
  v -> u with capacity c, cost 1   (using this means road i is reversed)

Then we:
1) Compute the maximum possible S-T flow ignoring costs.
2) Among all maximum flows, minimize the total number of reversed-road usages
   using min-cost max-flow on the above network.
3) Output the maximum flow value and the list of road ids whose reverse edge
   carries positive flow in the chosen solution.

Assumed input format:
n m s t
